 "missing": [],
 "notes": "biomes.h is generated from the live oracle objects (make -C oracle biomes-h). getFloatTemperature exists three times natively (features_lakes.c, populate.c, render_blocks.c). The play/play.c sky colour port is outside the tick. The spawn lists of every registered biome are checked by test_biome_spawn.c against BiomeSpawnProbe (slot 161 carries biomeID 160, so lists are looked up by id). Closed by lane/idxworld (verification): every member is ported or n/a, and the ports are held by the worldgen gates against the oracle's chunk and population dumps (test_worldgen, test_populate over out/java/chunks and out/java/populate: 35 overworld regions and seven seed worlds byte for byte), the spawn lists of every registered biome by test_biome_spawn (out/java/biome_spawn/bs-1), the colours by the mesh gate (test_meshes), and the weather and fire rules by the whole-server recordings in evidence."
}
